Browse the web with Microsoft's Chromium-based browser

Microsoft Edge is Microsoft's web browser, built on Chromium. It syncs your favorites, passwords and history with a Microsoft account across devices and runs extensions from the Chrome Web Store. This is an unofficial AppImage that repacks Microsoft's own Linux package unchanged and is rebuilt daily when a new Stable version comes out.

- Sync favorites, passwords, history and open tabs with a Microsoft account
- Runs extensions from the Chrome Web Store and Microsoft's add-ons store
- Tracking prevention with selectable strictness levels
- Vertical tabs, tab groups and Collections for organizing pages
- Immersive Reader and Read Aloud for distraction-free reading
- Copilot in the sidebar
